@startuml
title Task 7 — RAG evaluation flow (golden set)

actor Tester
participant "tools/evaluate.py" as Eval
participant "embeddings_service\n(/embed)" as Emb
database "Qdrant" as Qdrant
participant "RAG policy\n(MIN_SCORE_KNOWN / MIN_SCORE_UNKNOWN\n+ blocked_sources guard)" as Policy
participant "LLM / Stub\n(optional in evaluation)" as LLM
collections "logs.jsonl" as Logs

note over Eval
For each question in golden_questions.jsonl:
- expected: true/false
- must_include_sources (for expected=true)
- blocked_sources (for prompt injection checks)
end note

Tester -> Eval: start evaluation

loop for each question
  Eval -> Emb: POST /embed(question)
  Emb --> Eval: vector

  Eval -> Qdrant: search top-k(vector)\n(collection=knowledge_base)
  Qdrant --> Eval: chunks + scores + sources

  Eval -> Policy: decide threshold\nexpected? -> MIN_SCORE_KNOWN : MIN_SCORE_UNKNOWN\ncheck blocked_sources
  Policy --> Eval: chunks_found? + blocked_hit?

  alt expected == true AND chunks_found == true
    Eval -> LLM: (optional) build answer from top chunk\n(stub in evaluation)
    LLM --> Eval: answer
    Eval -> Eval: success = has must_include_sources
  else expected == true AND chunks_found == false
    Eval -> Eval: answer = "Я не знаю"\n(success=false)
  else expected == false
    alt blocked_hit == true
      Eval -> Eval: answer = "Я не знаю"\n(pass=true; blocked_hit=true)
    else
      Eval -> Eval: answer = "Я не знаю"\n(pass=true)
    end
  end

  Eval -> Logs: append JSONL row\n(ts, id, question, threshold,\n top_score, chunks_found, sources,\n blocked_hit, pass/fail)
end

Eval --> Tester: summary metrics\n(total/pass/fail/errors/accuracy)

note right of Policy
Possible failures:
- empty/incorrect index or wrong collection
- invalid payload / missing "source"
- threshold too high / too low
- irrelevant retrieval (false positive)
- prompt injection chunk retrieved (mitigated by guard + "Я не знаю")
end note

@enduml